	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre per Christum servatorem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod tam accurate tamque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>diligenter ad omnia mea inter tot negotiorum undas scribis, non tam solitum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quam gratum facis eoque nos, imo universam nostram ecclesiam tibi alioquin <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>obstrictam longe devinctiorem reddis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dominus tibi rependat, quandoquidem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ego illud non possum rependere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Caeterum quod minus intelligas, quid me <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>male habeat in praescriptionibus, quibus utuntur antichristi satellites erga <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ministros ecclesiarum, sic habe: <persName>Fridolini</persName> illius pastoris in <placeName ref="l2870">Rümlang</placeName> filius<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Jakob Keller, Sohn von Fridolin Keller (s. Zürich StA, A 272, Nr. 167).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>se apud Episcopios<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">d. h. bei den Bischofszellern.</note> sic insinuarat, ut inscio nostro magistratu sufficeretur <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>in Finsleri locum; iurare item debuit in aliquot articulos, qui ecclesiis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nostris non erant tolerandi, quorum capita, ut <persName ref="p8421">Bovillus</persName> noster descripsit <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mitto:</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">1. wil er im ein jar bestimpt han, in dem sol er hafft sin, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>und wenn er nit belyben oder er in nitt mehr dulden welte, ye<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>der dem andern 4 monat zevor abkünden.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">2. alle sontag und <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>andere nodturfftige tag predigen, 3. nutt anders dann die biblisch <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>gschrifft und das heilig evangelium predigen, nit zuͦ ufruor, sonder <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>zuͦ frid, ruͦw und einigkeit; 4. das er welle nach dem land<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>frieden predigen.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">5. zun krancken lüten gon, die in irer kranckheit <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>trösten; 6. wer sin begert, die sacrament mitteilen; 7. einen erbaren <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><foreign xml:lang="la">(ut isti lenones solent)</foreign> unsträfflichen wandel fuͤren; 8. das <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ave Meryia mittag, vesper und fyrabend lüten; 9. sich mit ni<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>emands in eynicherley verstand inlassen; 10. den wuͦcherstier und das <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>faselschwin erhalten; 11. by vorigem corpus, wie das Benedictus ge<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>hept, belyben und in nitt wyter anforderen.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">In summa: muͦß dreck <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><foreign xml:lang="la">(honos sit auribus tuis)</foreign> under haberkernen vermischen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Vides, <persName ref="p495">B<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ullingere</persName> charissime, quantum periculi nobis, imo ecclesiis nostrae fidei praemissis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>immineret, si sic procederetur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed de his satis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod articulos <placeName ref="l296">Londinen<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sium</placeName> adtinet, non video alios esse quam christianos, utque utinam dominus det <placeName ref="l830">Angli<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>canae</placeName> ecclesiae in hac confessione perseveranter et constanter perdurare.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Hoc unum (quamvis minutum) et in articulis et in catechismo desidero, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quod velim authoritates scripturae, et quibus decerpti sunt, adiunctas, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ne forte papatus et simpliciores putent ex doctorum cerebris haec <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>omnia enata esse atque eo confidentius ea in posterum convellere niterentur.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p6589">Servetus</persName>, hydra illa <placeName>Lernea</placeName>, utinam e medio sublatus esset; nam per disci<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>pulos suos olim etiam nostram turbavit ecclesiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Marchionis terra ferro et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>flamma grassante quotidie excinditur; ipsum fama fert <persName>Brunsvigi</persName> esse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Papistae nostri aiunt <persName>Caesarem</persName> induciis cum <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> factis comitia <placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>indixisse; an vera sint, ignoro; malim Utopiam quam <placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName>; fides <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>tamen sit penes authores.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Catechismum <placeName ref="l830">Anglicanum</placeName>, quem per <persName ref="p8421">Bovillum</persName> mihi donasti, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>recepi agoque gratias ingentes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta ex me pios.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>te fratres ac symmystae mei quam officiosissime.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale diu ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Christi nobisque incolumis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l441">Scaffusii</placeName> anno 1553, datum adscribere non <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>potui; quotidie enim expectabam reditum <persName ref="p7187">Ziegleri</persName> ad vos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Tuus ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z44"/><persName ref="p3481">Simpertus Vogtius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
